SUMMARY:How the Parks Were Built - CCC
DTSTAMP:20260813T094917Z
DTSTART:20260822T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Explore the lives of the men enrolled in the Civilian Conservat
	ion Corps and how their hard work and dedication can still be seen today a
