UID:I0QkV5xS-tYDyVPiZXEDR
SUMMARY:September 11 National Day of Service
DTSTAMP:20260813T094917Z
DTSTART:20260911T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Hermann Park Conservancy on Friday\, September 11\, from 9
	:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. for a meaningful morning of service in Hermann Park
	. \nIn recognition of the 9/11 National Day of Service and Remembrance\, v
	olunteers will unite for good by participating in hands-on projects that h
	elp care for and beautify the Park. Projects may include gardening\, plant
	ing\, mulching\, litter removal\, and other seasonal maintenance activitie
	s. \nTogether\, we will honor the spirit of service\, strengthen our commu
	nity\, and make a lasting impact on one of Houston’s most treasured public
	 spaces. All tools and project instructions will be provided. \nSign up fo
	r a session at McGovern Centennial Gardens\, the Commons\, or the Heart of
	 the Park HERE.\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/september-11-national-day
	-of-service/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/september-11-national-day-of-service/
LOCATION:McGovern Centennial Gardens\, 1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX\, 
	77004\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
